    "assignment": "Design a data-ingestion pipeline that handles overload using backpressure. Include a throttling control point, a queue to buffer bursts, and at least one consumer that processes messages before writing to the database. Ensure there is an end-to-end path from the producer to the database, and avoid architectures where the producer bypasses the intake/throttling layer or where the queue writes directly to the database."
